@agentorg/looper

Its compaction follows pi (https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono): the cut that keeps the latest
steps, the files carried from one summary to the next, and the message a summary is sent to the
model in are pi's. The summary is written by what the looper's host gives; @agentorg/summary's,
adapted from pi too, has its own notice. pi is under the MIT License:

